#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/analog.md:10
msgid "ADC, DAC and synchronized sampling"
msgstr "ADC、DAC 与同步采样"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/analog.md:12
msgid ""
"Select the numeric format, conversion or output geometry, trigger and "
"borrowing contract before starting a sample operation. The provider retains "
"responsibility for actual DMA, trigger and peripheral withdrawal."
msgstr "开始采样操作前，选择数值格式、转换或输出几何、触发及借用合同。provider 仍负责实际 DMA、触发及外设撤回。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/analog.md:16
msgid "Select independent sampling or one coupled owner"
msgstr "选择独立采样或一个耦合所有者"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/analog.md:18
msgid ""
"Ordinary ADC/DAC, groups and observers remain independent interfaces. A "
"control application needing one coherent PWM/ADC schedule selects a separate"
" coupled face; the ordinary PWM/ADC method tables and states do not grow to "
"hold it."
msgstr ""
"普通 ADC/DAC、组接口和观察者仍为独立接口。需要一致 PWM/ADC 调度的控制应用，选择单独的耦合接口；普通 PWM/ADC "
"方法表和状态不会为此扩大。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/analog.md:0
msgid "Face / target"
msgstr "接口 / 目标"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/analog.md:0
msgid "Selected behavior"
msgstr "选定行为"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/analog.md:0
msgid "Borrow and execution"
msgstr "借用与执行"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/analog.md:0
msgid "`pwm_adc.h` / `Nexus::IOPWMADC`"
msgstr "`pwm_adc.h` / `Nexus::IOPWMADC`"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/analog.md:0
msgid ""
"A finite window with one fixed complete duty frame and triggered raw samples"
msgstr "有限窗口，使用一个固定、完整的占空比帧和触发式原始采样"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/analog.md:0
msgid ""
"Task submission/service; request, duty and samples borrowed until acquire-"
"observed SETTLED"
msgstr "由 Task 提交和推进；request、占空比和样本持续被借用，直至通过 acquire 语义观察到 SETTLED"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/analog.md:0
msgid "`pwm_adc_loop.h` / `Nexus::IOPWMADCLoop`"
msgstr "`pwm_adc_loop.h` / `Nexus::IOPWMADCLoop`"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/analog.md:0
msgid ""
"A finite-lifetime continuous session; each complete scan invokes bounded "
"compute and stages one complete duty group"
msgstr "生命周期有限的连续会话；每次完整扫描调用有界计算，并暂存一个完整占空比组"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/analog.md:0
msgid ""
"Task prepare/start/service/stop; compute runs only in the selected ADC IRQ"
msgstr "由 Task 执行 prepare/start/service/stop；compute 仅在选定 ADC IRQ 中运行"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/analog.md:27
msgid ""
"The current F407ZGT6 software reference selects TIM8 CH1..3, BKIN and "
"ADC1_IN0. `finite-regular-dma` uses TIM8 TRGO, ADC regular conversion and "
"DMA2 Stream4; `injected-control` uses TIM8 CH4 and injected JEOC without "
"DMA. These alternative modes share the same controller resources and cannot "
"be selected together. Neither establishes power-board wiring, complementary "
"outputs, FOC, a measured aperture timestamp or an exact physical PWM pulse "
"count. See the [coupled provider contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/pwm_adc/README.md) for the exact route, "
"clocks and timing inequalities."
msgstr ""
"当前 F407ZGT6 软件参考选择 TIM8 CH1..3、BKIN 和 ADC1_IN0。`finite-regular-dma` 使用 TIM8 "
"TRGO、ADC 规则转换和 DMA2 Stream4；`injected-control` 使用 TIM8 CH4 和注入组 JEOC，不使用 "
"DMA。这两个互斥模式占用相同控制器资源，不能同时选择。它们都不确立功率板接线、互补输出、FOC、实测采样时刻时间戳或精确物理 PWM "
"脉冲计数。精确路线、时钟和时序不等式参见[耦合 provider 合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/pwm_adc/README.md)。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/analog.md:36
msgid ""
"The IRQ session has explicit trigger, conversion, IRQ-delay, compute and "
"commit budgets. Its callback must return within budget; software cannot "
"preempt it. It cannot call task-only I/O, OS, Flash, file or network "
"methods, nor retain callback-local scan/output views. Session, buffers, "
"callback and context remain exclusively borrowed through SETTLED, even after"
" output inhibition. A separately owned bounded queue/mailbox can transfer "
"targets under its own synchronization contract; tasks must not mutate live "
"borrowed algorithm state field by field."
msgstr ""
"IRQ 会话显式声明触发、转换、IRQ 延迟、计算和提交预算。回调必须在预算内返回；软件无法抢占它。回调不能调用仅限任务的 "
"I/O、OS、Flash、文件或网络方法，也不能保留仅在回调内有效的扫描或输出视图。即使输出已被禁止，会话、缓冲区、回调和上下文仍被独占借用，直至 "
"SETTLED。另行持有的有界队列或邮箱，可按自身同步合同传递目标；任务不得逐字段修改正在借用中的算法状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/analog.md:44
msgid ""
"Late IRQ, lost-cycle evidence, invalid duty, break or failed full-group "
"commit closes output admission. Stop/service must still drain sources and "
"join IRQs; failed withdrawal retains storage, and cold "
"close/reinitialization establishes the next session. Finite deadline and "
"completed-cycle counters are software contracts, not measured worst-case "
"control latency or physical qualification."
msgstr ""
"IRQ 迟到、检测到丢失周期、占空比无效、刹车事件或完整组提交失败，都会关闭输出准入。Stop/service 仍须排空事件源，并等待 IRQ "
"结束；撤回失败时继续保留存储借用，必须经冷态关闭和重新初始化才能建立下一会话。有限 deadline "
"和已完成周期计数是软件合同，不是实测的最坏控制延迟，也不代表物理验收通过。"

