#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/analog.md:54
msgid ""
"No buffer is retained. Triggered output waits for a later trigger; waveform "
"offsets must leave room for the selected amplitude. External-event ports "
"require a running source; stopped writes do not implicitly reopen trigger "
"detection."
msgstr "不保留任何缓冲区。触发输出等待后续触发；波形偏移须为选定振幅留出空间。外部事件端口要求源正在运行；在停止状态写入不会隐式重新启用触发检测。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/analog.md:54
