"UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS、INVALID、BUSY、STATE、TIMEOUT、EXHAUSTED、IO、CONTEXT 或 UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/analog.md:54
