#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/analog.md:54
msgid ""
"This explicit two-channel profile reports code_bits and zero-based "
"output_codes slots in channel order. Codes do not measure voltage or analog "
"settling. The provider removes native alignment/scaling; unused native low "
"bits are not represented by a narrower selected code unit."
msgstr ""
"该显式双通道 profile 报告 code_bits，并按通道顺序使用从零开始的 output_codes "
"slot。数字码不测量电压或模拟稳定时间。provider 移除原生对齐／缩放；较窄的所选码单位不表示未使用的原生低位。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/analog.md:54
msgid "Shared immutable operations; callbacks receive instance context."
msgstr "共享的不可变方法表；回调接收实例 context。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/analog.md:54
msgid "Face and caller/provider storage outlive all uses and full close."
msgstr "接口及调用者／provider 存储必须存活至所有使用和完整 close 结束。"

